Would you like to share more about what climate change means to you?"}

{"conversation_id":"7aeb6939-42dc-49e2-bd6c-e844b8b5e583","response":"I care about how you're feeling and want to help. It sounds like you're experiencing some challenging emotions right now. When I listen to what you're sharing, I sense that these feelings might be connected to deeper patterns of feeling disconnected and alone. Would you be open to exploring why these thoughts are emerging?

